  "title": "Lument Finance Trust Announces Quarter-End Earnings Release and Investor Call Dates",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, May 12, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“we,”; “LFT” or “the Company”) announced today that it expects to file its Quarterly Report on Form 10-Q for the quarter ended March 31, 2026 with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Friday, May 15, 2026, before the market opens, and invites investors and other interested parties",
